===============================================================================
Data sources
===============================================================================

Pulse reads status information that providers publish themselves, through their
own public status pages and feeds. It reports what those official sources say.

Pulse performs no independent availability measurement of its own: it does not
probe, poll or test any provider's service, and it makes no claim about a
provider's availability beyond what that provider has published. Pulse is
independent of every company it lists.
